  "term": "therapeutic exercise",
  "definition": "A therapeutic exercise in which a practitioner helps a person enter a semi-hypnotic state by using calming, positive mental images. It is used as a distraction and attention-based method for problems such as pain, hyperventilation, panic, and other conditions.",
